			"notes": {
				"rationale": "ein paar is one Lexeme PRON ein paar in every use, as ein wenig is (de/quantifier-by-use). Its ein is fixed and never inflects, so it is no article of Sekunden and gives no Article evidence: singular ein agreeing with plural Sekunden would fail ADR 0040's check. Here it stands before a noun; Sekunden stays its own word, not a member."
			},
